26:T4e5,Most rejected proposals fail in the same place: the research question. Not because the topic is uninteresting, but because the question is unanswerable, unmeasurable, or already answered.

## Topic, problem, question

A topic is a subject area. A problem is a tension inside that area — something unresolved, contradictory or unmeasured. A question is a specific, testable formulation of that tension.

- Topic: remote work and productivity.
- Problem: studies disagree on the direction and size of the effect.
- Question: under which task types does remote work change measured output for knowledge workers?

## Three filters

1. **Reachability** — can you obtain the data, sample or documents within your timeframe?
2. **Measurability** — is there a defensible operational definition for each construct?
3. **Contribution** — if answered, does something change for a reader, a policy or a field?

> A question that passes two filters is a chapter. A question that passes three is a thesis.

## Then reverse-engineer the method

Once the question is fixed, the methodology writes itself: the design follows the question type, the sample follows the population, the analysis follows the construct definitions. That is the order reviewers expect.1d:["$","$L25",null,{"data":{"shots":"$1c:props:shots","sections":{"intro":{"id":"intro","title":{"en":"One world. Five divisions. A single connected system.","ne":"एउटै संसार। पाँच विभाग। एक जोडिएको प्रणाली।"},"body":{"en":"Acttolog connects research, entertainment, learning, play and discovery so an idea can begin as a question, become a lesson, ship as media or a game, and stay supplied with verified tools.","ne":"Acttolog ले अनुसन्धान, मनोरञ्जन, सिकाइ, खेल र खोजलाई जोड्छ — ताकि एउटा विचार प्रश्नबाट सुरु भई पाठ बन्न, मिडिया वा खेल बन्न र प्रमाणित औजारले भरिइरहन सकोस्।"},"visible":true},"eco":{"id":"eco","title":{"en":"The Acttolog Orbital Ecosystem","ne":"Acttolog अर्बिटल इकोसिस्टम"},"body":{"en":"Five divisions orbit one world. Select a node to enter.","ne":"पाँच विभाग एउटै संसारको परिक्रमा गर्छन्। प्रवेश गर्न नोड छान्नुहोस्।"},"visible":true},"divisions":{"id":"divisions","title":{"en":"Inside the divisions","ne":"विभागहरू भित्र"},"body":{"en":"Each division stands alone and connects to the others.","ne":"प्रत्येक विभाग स्वतन्त्र छ र अरूसँग जोडिन्छ।"},"visible":true},"featured":{"id":"featured","title":{"en":"Featured in the World","ne":"संसारका विशेष सामग्री"},"body":{"en":"Curated from the Acttolog content library.","ne":"Acttolog सामग्री पुस्तकालयबाट छानिएको।"},"visible":true},"latest":{"id":"latest","title":{"en":"Latest across the ecosystem","ne":"इकोसिस्टमका नवीनतम सामग्री"},"body":{"en":"Blog, research, entertainment and discovery updates.","ne":"ब्लग, अनुसन्धान, मनोरञ्जन र खोज अपडेट।"},"visible":true},"academy":{"id":"academy","title":{"en":"Acttolog Academy","ne":"Acttolog एकेडेमी"},"body":{"en":"Structured learning built from research practice.","ne":"अनुसन्धान अभ्यासबाट बनेको संरचित सिकाइ।"},"visible":true},"darkroom":{"id":"darkroom","tit